OL,5,G1445 Opening Lines
OL,6,     FThe series that looks at books,
OL,7,     Fplays and stories and how they
OL,8,     Fwork. John Yorke shows how Dorothy
OL,9,     FL Sayers's ambitious 1930 crime
OL,10,     Fnovel pushed the boundaries of
OL,11,     Fdetective fiction.
OL,12,G1500 A Good Read
OL,13,     FAuthors Sarah Dunant and Peter
OL,14,     FJames choose books they love.
OL,15,G1530 Curious Cases
OL,16,     F6/13. Hannah Fry and Dara O Briain
OL,17,     Fcelebrate fireworks in a sparkling
OL,18,     Fepisode exploring the science,
OL,19,     Fhistory and occasionally
OL,20,     Fsurprising applications of these
OL,21,     Fjoyful explosions!
